  // GrabPay, UPI, ...) reports that the money finally arrived: its
  // `checkout.session.completed` can fire while the session is still unpaid, which
  // fulfilCheckoutSession correctly treats as "not yet". Same idempotent call.
  // (Owner action: enable this event on the Stripe webhook endpoint before turning
  // any local method on — see docs/DOCUMENTATION.md, Local payment methods.)
  if (event.type === "checkout.session.completed" || event.type === "checkout.session.async_payment_succeeded") {
