/**
 * Read side of the first-party customer activity record — ONE place that turns
 * every source about a customer into a single typed timeline:
 *
 *   ActivityEvent      (lib/activity-events.ts — payments, wizard field changes,
 *                       abandonment, actions, errors shown, auth)
 *   AuditLog           (existing: server.*, gameserver.*, billing.*, wallet.*, user.*)
 *   Visit              (existing: portal page views, with time on page + device)
 *   DeployFunnelEvent  (existing: wizard steps reached, selections, errors, completes)
 *
 * Consumers: the admin customer page (components/admin/client360/tabs/ActivityTab.tsx)
 * and any report that needs a customer journey — call these, don't re-query.
 * Plain module (no server-only) so scripts can use it too.
 */
